35
00:03:50.887 --> 00:03:54.846
to the side of her bed. He leaned down to give her a kiss, but luckily for

36
00:03:54.847 --> 00:04:04.146
Arthur, Van Helsing abruptly pulled him backward just as Lucy lunged forward and growled. Her face turned hard

37
00:04:04.147 --> 00:04:09.083
with anger and her eyes flashed a fiery red. She bared her sharp, white teeth, and then

38
00:04:09.084 --> 00:04:14.257
her eyes fluttered shut. One final breath escaped her lungs. Arthur instantly collapsed into my arms, weeping. Van

39
00:04:14.258 --> 00:04:17.797
Helsing stood tall behind me, put his hand on my shoulder and said, "This is only the

40
00:04:17.798 --> 00:04:21.479
beginning . . ." A few days after the funeral, Van Helsing and I were drinking cups

41
00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:29.765
of hot milk before bed when he pulled out a newspaper from his bag and placed it on

42
